 "grammar": {
  "title": {
   "ko": "There is / There are와 방 안의 물건",
   "en": "There is / There are with rooms and furniture"
  },
  "explain": {
   "ko": "방 안에 무엇이 있는지는 There is / There are로 말하고, 방 안은 in, 옆은 next to로 나타냅니다. 질문은 Is there ~? / Are there ~?입니다.",
   "en": "Say what is in a room with There is / There are, use 'in' for inside a room and 'next to' for beside. Ask with Is there ~? / Are there ~?"
  },
  "table": {
   "head": [
    "표현 / Pattern",
    "예 / Example"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "There is + 단수",
     "There is a sofa."
    ],
    [
     "There are + 복수",
     "There are two windows."
    ],
    [
     "in + 방",
     "in the kitchen"
    ],
    [
     "Is there ~?",
     "Is there a bed in the room?"
    ]
   ]
  },
  "notes": [
   {
    "ko": "방 안은 in을 씁니다: in the kitchen.",
    "en": "Use 'in' for inside a room: in the kitchen."
   },
   {
    "ko": "하나는 There is, 여럿은 There are.",
    "en": "One thing: There is. Many things: There are."
   },
   {
    "ko": "질문은 Is there ~? / Are there ~?",
    "en": "Ask with: Is there ~? / Are there ~?"
   }
  ],
